{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（21日）中午12時41分，紅磡崇安街26號一間中學，一名40餘歲男工人在學校1樓位置墮下，倒在地上腳和腰受傷。學校職員報警，由救護車將他送院，警方列工業意外跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"工人送院時面露痛楚神情。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156229577014644736591704.jpeg/mZwVgf-XX7KLBHBXpRmhSztXdui9A1qZVM5H41TOR-M\"/><figcaption>工人送院時面露痛楚神情。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受傷工人被送往醫院治理。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156230805236748288539170.jpeg/PPYNQTqh_noakdrrPEWFjJtEZfkeAHAKkfFRopHxUaI\"/><figcaption>受傷工人被送往醫院治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工人由工友陪同送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156229574795726848243971.jpeg/uJn4QjzkqrH79xCGRXeodlIR0_9yK3WAv7OyD7-zsg8\"/><figcaption>工人由工友陪同送院。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T05:38:42.029772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}